flowchart TD
    %% Sources: prope_source_of_truth.md 4.3, 10.5, S7, H-05, Release 3; business-analysis.md FR-04/FR-07/NFR-02.

    start([Start: Developer wants to put a revision in use])
    entry["[TBD Screen] Developer Release Entry"]
    permission{Permission to release?\nRules: Unverified / TBD}
    denied[Access Unavailable]
    detail[Release Detail]
    approved{Revision status is Approved?}
    warning[Not Approved for Production]
    environment["[TBD Screen] Environment or Usage Context"]
    release[Release Approved Revision]
    result{Release succeeds?\nFailure behavior: Unverified / TBD}
    failed[Unverified / TBD: Release Failed]
    in_use[In Use - Version ID and Release History]
    end([End: approved revision in use])
    end_denied([End: release not permitted])
    end_not_ready([End: return to revision or review])

    start --> entry
    entry --> permission
    permission -->|No| denied
    denied --> end_denied
    permission -->|Yes| detail
    detail -->|View owner, revision, approval, environment| approved
    approved -->|No| warning
    warning -->|Return to Prompt Detail| end_not_ready
    approved -->|Yes| environment
    environment -->|Release to environment| release
    release --> result
    result -->|No| failed
    failed -->|Retry| environment
    failed -->|Cancel| detail
    result -->|Yes| in_use
    in_use --> end
